</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER>Druid Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

Updated March 2006.


Druidic skills/spells are:
Name: The Humble Druids
Command: druids
Creator: Lanfear
Maximum level: 30


Description:
Druids are seekers of justice, and nature's defenders. They protect the
 environment with a fierce passion. Their ability to use natures given
 components to fight injustices make them formidable opponents in both
 physical and mental disciplines.
 

Joining requirements:
 Must pass 1 out of the following:
  Alignment must be neutral (too good)
  Alignment must be good (passed)
  (passed)
 Background must be good_religious (wrong or incomplete)


Abilities gained when joining:
 May train skill Attack to 19%
 May train skill Bludgeons to 19%
 May train skill Cast control to 9%
 May train skill Cast help to 4%
 May train skill Cast information to 4%
 May train skill Cast generic to 28%
 May train skill Cast runes to 19%
 May train skill Cast special to 9%
 May train skill Consider to 19%
 May train skill Fire building to 19%
 May train skill Plant lore to 19%
 May train skill Torch creation to 19%
 May study spell Detect alignment to 10%

 
 You receive the benefits of the Druids.


